{"id":"m4-043","m":4,"paper":"2016年江苏省公务员录用考试《行测》题（A类）","region":"江苏","year":2016,"q":14,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"1788600","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，1，5，35，(   )</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"315"},{"k":"B","t":"215"},{"k":"C","t":"115"},{"k":"D","t":"96"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列存在明显的倍数关系，优先考虑<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>商。<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>商后得到新数列：1，3，5，7，（9），为连续奇数列，下一项为9，则题干所求项为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-44fbbc29ba27aa12.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"1788602","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8d82a5fa5c30777a.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-99e62bee3d75ab0d.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-63e2e1ddeccdce34.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a96353b23b2bf066.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a266a460d0d1fe88.png\" />，(   )</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fe21401f9125e6ac.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c2375e1d91e9b526.png\" /><br></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-74ebc8ed3c4f65da.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f6ddd6ef6a565679.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>分数数列前四项规律明显，分母部分作差可得：2，4，8，（16），是公比为2的等比数列，则第五项可转化为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-468d32fb5f71a063.png\" />。依此，所求项分母应为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a21290be58250182.png\" />。只有C项满足。</p><p>验证：将第五项转化为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-468d32fb5f71a063.png\" />后，分子部分作差可得：2，4，6，8，（10），为连续偶数列，则所求项分子部分为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-007f509d90a1a601.png\" />，与选项吻合。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"1788604","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"4.2，5.2，8.4，17.8，44.22，(   )","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"125.62"},{"k":"B","t":"85.26"},{"k":"C","t":"99.44"},{"k":"D","t":"125.64"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>题干为小数数列，作差无规律，考虑机械划分。整数部分为：4，5，8，17，44，相邻两项作差得到新数列为1，3，9，27，是公比为3的等比数列，则新数列下一项为81，原数列整数部分为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-41a93d78d6a33355.png\" />，排除B、C两项。小数部分为2，2，4，8，22，相邻两项作差得到新数列①为0，2，4，14，再次作差无规律，考虑对新数列①相邻两项作和，得到新数列②为2，6，18，是公比为3的等比数列，所以新数列②的下一项为54，新数列①的下一项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3479e95800cdd5b8.png\" />，因此小数部分的下一项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2183e163135ca104.png\" />，排除D项。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p><p>备注：本题也可以小数部分结合整数部分找规律，奇数项中，整数部分为小数部分的2倍，偶数项中整数部分为小数部分的2倍多1，故第六项应满足整数部分为小数部分的2倍多1，只有A项满足。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"1788606","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>2，3，4，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-38419184c18aa8e6.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3745e66d2e0055d0.png\" />，（    ）</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p>81</p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c99e75b3494f4cf9.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a1141167e7e5de03.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p>9</p>"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>将数列统一转化为根号形式，则原数列转化为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9e96b20f6c8f3e3.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cfca030dbd39e407.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fe2a77dbac724ca3.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5e5332a0c9a7b5f0.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3745e66d2e0055d0.png\" />，（  ）。根号内数字变化幅度较小且呈递增趋势，优先考虑作差。作差后可得：5，7，11，19，（  ）。二次作差得：2，4，8，（16），判定其是公比为2的等比数列，下一项为16。故所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-605baf68d014b4f3.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-50630f77303fe0b2.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"1788608","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"已知A、B两地相距600千米，甲乙两车同时从A、B两地相向而行，3小时相遇。若甲的速度是乙的1.5倍，则甲的速度是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"60千米/小时"},{"k":"B","t":"80千米/小时"},{"k":"C","t":"90千米/小时"},{"k":"D","t":"120千米/小时"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设乙的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千米/小时，甲的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ce7a5952347b40b9.png\" />千米/小时，由题目可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-afab7e77ecb66dc7.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5b7d7a1b00d8c071.png\" />，则甲速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8bfe0e19d06a0678.png\" />千米/小时。</p><p>方法二：因甲、乙时间相同，且甲速度是乙的1.5倍，则甲的路程∶乙的路程<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-838e043e55fb6283.png\" />，共5份。已知总路程为600千米，所以一份为120千米，甲的路程为360千米，所以甲的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-052efc73008316a4.png\" />千米/小时。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"1788610","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某班有38名同学，一次数学测验共有两题，答对第一题的有26人，答对第二题的有24人，两题都答对的有17人，则两题都答错的人数是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3"},{"k":"B","t":"5"},{"k":"C","t":"6"},{"k":"D","t":"7"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据两集合容斥原理公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-763030eefa2a7e61.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-22fabb63649bea11.png\" /> 。则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e3e10f047b3262f0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8cba0b1660f5350f.png\" />，根据尾数法，两题都答错的人数尾数为5。 </p><p>故正确答案为B。 </p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"1788612","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>甲、乙、丙三人共同完成一项工程，他们的工作效率之比是5：4：6。先由甲、乙两人合作6天，再由乙单独做9天，完成全部工程的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />，若剩下的工程由丙单独完成，则丙所需要的天数是：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"9"},{"k":"B","t":"11"},{"k":"C","t":"10"},{"k":"D","t":"15"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题目中的效率比，设甲、乙、丙的效率分别为5，4，6，由题干可得工程总量<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1acceb4fe136ca44.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-753f1a64fe474a9e.png\" />，剩余工作量<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-310b2bc5aee03688.png\" />，故丙所需时间<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23487bdf0fefa883.png\" />天。 </p><p>故正确答案为C。 </p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"1788614","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"有A、B、C三支试管，分别装有10克、20克、30克的水，现将某种盐溶液10克倒入A管均匀混合，并取出10克溶液倒入B管均匀混合，再从B管中取出10克溶液倒入C管。若这时C管中溶液的浓度为2.5%，则原盐溶液的浓度是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"60%"},{"k":"B","t":"55%"},{"k":"C","t":"50%"},{"k":"D","t":"45%"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>假设原盐溶液浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />，将溶液倒入A试管中，混合之后的浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ddf383430153d4c0.png\" />，同理经过B、C试管的混合之后溶液浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-27b90a6830cab66a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-59cd7ea3f1b33463.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5717346e32d52fda.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"1788616","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某志愿服务小组购买一批牛奶到一敬老院慰问老人，如果送给每位老人四盒牛奶，那么还剩28盒，如果送给每位老人5盒，那么最后一位老人又不足4盒，则该敬老院的老人人数至少是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"27"},{"k":"B","t":"29"},{"k":"C","t":"30"},{"k":"D","t":"33"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>假设该敬老院老人人数为 <img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />人，每人分配5盒时最后一位老人分得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-71c4bedd785263f1.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-40b98f88a25bf441.png\" />盒牛奶，则可得到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7befc695d085da94.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f9551f8236e08425.png\" />，要使得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />值最小，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-71c4bedd785263f1.png\" />应取最大值3， 则该敬老院至少有老人30人。 </p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"1788618","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小王以每股10元的相同价格买入A和B两只股票共1000股，此后A股先跌<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />再涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，B股先涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />再跌<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，若此期间小王没有再买卖过这两只股票，则现在这1000股股票的市值是：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"10250元"},{"k":"B","t":"9975元"},{"k":"C","t":"10000元"},{"k":"D","t":"9750元"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设买入的A股票为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />股，则买入的B股票为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f1513b3c5bc1208d.png\" />股。A股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-58d846b6cddd64a5.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-38ff83e255ca8ebf.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f4c6dd9ec618169a.png\" />元，B股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f103942583a1ab8e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b6098daf124cf527.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-abb162cb5b9ecdac.png\" />元，则两只股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-299a4dd7c46f3987.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-44b7a5cc2fca5dee.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e50ae4f20d2b393a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9cbcad724459d9c.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":11,"qid":"1788620","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小明、小红、小桃三人定期到某棋馆学围棋，小明每隔3天去一次，小红每隔4天去一次，小桃每隔5天去一次，若2016年2月10日三人恰好在棋馆相遇，则下次三人在棋馆相遇的日期是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"2016年4月8日"},{"k":"B","t":"2016年4月11日"},{"k":"C","t":"2016年4月9日"},{"k":"D","t":"2016年4月10日"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>小明每隔3天去一次，小红每隔4天去一次，小桃每隔5天去一次，则分别相当于每4、5、6天去一次，则三个人再过4、5、6的最小公倍数60天再次在棋馆相遇。2016年为闰年，二月份有29天，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-27918de19b5e1be9.png\" />，则他们4月10日再次在棋馆相遇。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":12,"qid":"1788622","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>下图是由三个边长分别为4、6、x的正方形所组成的图形，直线AB将它分成面积相等的两部分，则x的值是：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1537941f0c08d42.jpg\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3或5"},{"k":"B","t":"2或4"},{"k":"C","t":"1或3"},{"k":"D","t":"1或6"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>如图所示，将原图补成一个长方形，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ecb8461afb10e396.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-580d926deefc7d07.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-37a1d435b71b4450.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d36ab3a03155bb9.png\" />。根据题意，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8809bd4432514970.png\" />，又<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7faa3060cb34494.png\" />，则两个补充的长方形面积相等，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3d19463dc553bb8f.png\" />，整理得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6b13693dc222251c.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9c71dfb10ef9ebac.png\" />。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1536e37d563b40f.png\" /></p><p>秒杀技巧：因直线AB将图形分成了面积相等的两个部分，故可将图形视为中心对称图形，此时两边两个小正方形一定全等，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-451f4013816859d5.png\" />，只有B项满足。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":13,"qid":"1788624","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一辆公交车从甲地开往乙地需经过三个红绿灯路口，在这三个路口遇到红灯的概率分别是0.4，0.5，0.6，则该车从甲地开往乙地遇到红灯的概率是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"0.12"},{"k":"B","t":"0.50"},{"k":"C","t":"0.88"},{"k":"D","t":"0.89"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>从甲地开往乙地遇到红灯的概率，即遇到至少一个红灯的概率。正面情况数较多，优先反面思考。遇到至少一个红灯的概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-959e5d047ac39639.png\" />。不遇到红灯的概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fed138226496eba1.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9f087c25d59438de.png\" />，则公交车从甲地开往乙地遇到红灯的概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2a51af3465604be3.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":14,"qid":"1788626","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>从1开始的自然数在正方形网格内按如图所示规律排列，第1个转弯数是2，第2个转弯数是3，第3个转弯数是5，第4个转弯数是7，第5个转弯数是10，···，则第22个转弯数是：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/153793f6b55e7ab.jpg\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"123"},{"k":"B","t":"131"},{"k":"C","t":"132"},{"k":"D","t":"133"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干规律，转弯的个数依次对应的转弯数分别为：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/153730bf1b54601.jpg\" /></p><p>分析表格中的“转弯数”可以发现，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-73c39b85e051f6d9.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-80784070ea74ff2f.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3438246b2b002176.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-59d185572fe37f1c.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-856e07c6160eeb65.png\" />，即第n个转弯数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3fb5944e4cd219a1.png\" />（进位取整），则第22个转弯数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-507c36ee4aef9915.png\" />。</p><p>再次分析，奇数项的转弯数又有规律：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5aa5fd51bfdafcf4.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7c2d58664b55bc8b.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d915e11aa2618e5c.png\" />，······。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1c4836ad4744e7e6.png\" />为第11个奇数，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bf36bf3977063230.png\" />。</p><p>故第22个转弯数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d26131fc35391df4.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}